                "label": "フ",
                "value": "7"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "α/β=-1+i=√2(cos3π/4+i sin3π/4)です。ド・モアブルの定理で20乗します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(\\alpha/\\beta)^{20}=-1024",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-farthest-point",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kawasaki-medical-2025-general-regional-quota-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 (2)(3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "|z-β|=√2は中心βの円です。αから最遠の点は中心を結ぶ直線の延長上にあります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\max|z-\\alpha|=6\\sqrt2,\\qquad z=\\frac{4-22i}{5}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "直線AB上のα、βを共役を含む式へ代入し、γを連立で決めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\gamma=\\frac{7-i}{20}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kawasaki-medical-2025-general-regional-quota-mathematics-answers-p011",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "zw=10よりz=10/wを直線の式へ代入し、w=u+ivとして平方完成します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(u-\\frac72\\right)^2+\\left(v-\\frac12\\right)^2=\\frac{25}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "△POQの面積は|z||w|=10を使うと5sinθです。最大はθ=π/2のときです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-area-ratio",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kawasaki-medical-2025-general-regional-quota-mathematics-answers-p012",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Pが直線AB上にある条件と偏角±π/4を組み合わせ、y=x、y=-xとの交点を求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P_1=(5/3,5/3),\\qquad P_2=(5/4,-5/4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "対応するQを|z||w|=10から求め、線分比を比較します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kawasaki-medical-2025-general-regional-quota-mathematics-answers-p013",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 (3) 結論",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "5:7",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "したがって、面積最大時に直線ABが△POQを分ける比は5:7です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
